{
  "id": "6ad1548f8d77f4a005e9c288",
  "title": "井戸端のダークテーマのタイポグラフィの再調整（2026-10）",
  "created": 1792103571,
  "updated": 1792494879,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ad1548f8d77f4a005e9c288",
      "text": "井戸端のダークテーマのタイポグラフィの再調整（2026-10）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103571,
      "updated": 1792103598
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1550200000000009f92bb",
      "text": "関連：",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103683,
      "updated": 1792103691
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad154ae00000000009f92b9",
      "text": " [RobotoよりUD系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103598,
      "updated": 1792103683
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad156c300000000009f92c7",
      "text": " [BIZ UDゴシック]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104131,
      "updated": 1792104137
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad242d300000000006d3cf1",
      "text": " [--page-font-family]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792164563,
      "updated": 1792164567
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad154b300000000009f92ba",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103603,
      "updated": 1792103603
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1552000000000009f92be",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103712,
      "updated": 1792104303
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1576e00000000009f92c8",
      "text": "\tダークテーマの日本語フォントに違和感を覚える気持ち is わかる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104303,
      "updated": 1792104303
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1550d00000000009f92bc",
      "text": " \t[\" [Summer498.icon]が久々に（？）見たら何か前とフォントが変わっている気がした][. [RobotoよりUD系フォントのほうが見やすくないか？#6a727b190000000000e8dbd3]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103693,
      "updated": 1792104305
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1550d00000000009f92bd",
      "text": " \t第一印象としてこうしたフィーリングはよくわかる（期間が空いたときも含む）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103693,
      "updated": 1792287033
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4213b0000000000ce00ec",
      "text": " \t\t目が慣れると気にならなくなるように思う",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287035,
      "updated": 1792287037
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad2412100000000006d3cea",
      "text": " \t\tWindows のメイリオのように",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792164130,
      "updated": 1792164146
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad155b000000000009f92c0",
      "text": " \t[字間]が狭すぎるのではないか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103856,
      "updated": 1792105910
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1579100000000009f92c9",
      "text": " \t\t最近、自分は試作の[Cosense用の本文フォントUserCSS]を使っているが、たまにUserCSSを外すと欧文も和文も字が詰まっているように見える（井戸端のスタイル指定の調整前後は毎回しばらく外している）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104338,
      "updated": 1792286622
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15a0b00000000009f92ce",
      "text": " 欧文フォントにも違和感を覚える",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104971,
      "updated": 1792104986
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad157e400000000009f92ca",
      "text": "\t\t[井戸端のダークテーマ]の欧文はCosense標準の [Roboto] (主にAndroid), [Helvetica] (主にiOS・Mac・Linux), [Arial]（Windowsの標準的な[Helvetica互換メトリクス]のフォント） の指定のままだが、これらはどれも大体同程度の字幅と字間のようだ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104421,
      "updated": 1792427548
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad1584600000000009f92cb",
      "text": "\t\tモバイルデバイスのスクリーンのようにテキストが狭めの領域に展開されている場合には適していても、比較的広い画面にはあまり向いていないのではないか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792104519,
      "updated": 1792105118
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15bcd00000000009f92d5",
      "text": "\t\t最近のGoogle系 [Material Design 3] の推奨フォントもRobotoに比べて若干幅の広い Roboto Flex だったりする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792105422,
      "updated": 1792105775
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15c5e00000000009f92d6",
      "text": "\tダークモードでは[イラディエーション][イラディエーション.icon]がより顕著になるが、Cosenseの標準テーマのタイポグラフィはカラースキームに依らず常に同じで、ダークテーマに合わせた最適化は特にされていない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792105566,
      "updated": 1792164398
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad2402400000000006d3ce7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792163876,
      "updated": 1792163876
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad23ffa00000000006d3ce5",
      "text": "\t昨今のウェブサイトでは閲覧環境間で表示を一貫させるためにWebフォントがよく導入されている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792163835,
      "updated": 1792163952
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad2402600000000006d3ce8",
      "text": " \tCosenseには標準で Font Awesome と Open Sans が導入されている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792163878,
      "updated": 1792164413
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad2415500000000006d3cee",
      "text": " \tただ、環境によって表示フォントが違うことが井戸端という共同編集環境で問題になったことは特になかったように思う",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792164181,
      "updated": 1792164181
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15abb00000000009f92d2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792105148,
      "updated": 1792105148
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15d0600000000009f92d7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792105734,
      "updated": 1792105734
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad15abb00000000009f92d3",
      "text": "\t参考資料としてMDNのフォント指定はInterに font-variation-settings を有効化したもの（のはず。あとで確認する）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792105148,
      "updated": 1792286727
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad240a800000000006d3ce9",
      "text": "\t\t大文字のIと小文字のLの見分けがつけられる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792164009,
      "updated": 1792164696
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad41fb60000000000ce00e6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792286646,
      "updated": 1792286646
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4223a0000000000ce00f6",
      "text": "条件：",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287290,
      "updated": 1792287423
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad422380000000000ce00f4",
      "text": "\tBIZ UDゴシックの字幅を広げる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287288,
      "updated": 1792287312
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4232c0000000000ce00f9",
      "text": "\t欧文フォントをRobotoやHelveticaより幅のゆったりしたフォントに変える",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287532,
      "updated": 1792287683
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad422560000000000ce00f7",
      "text": "\tライトテーマの和文フォント（Hiragino Sans またはブラウザ指定のフォント）の字幅を変更しない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287318,
      "updated": 1792287387
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad422c20000000000ce00f8",
      "text": "\t代替フォントの字間を個別に指定する手段はCSSにはない（はず）。両方広げるのであれば、欧文フォントにはデフォルトの字間がやや狭めのものを指定する必要がある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287426,
      "updated": 1792427873
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad422390000000000ce00f5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287289,
      "updated": 1792287289
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad420280000000000ce00ea",
      "text": "案（順不同）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792286760,
      "updated": 1792287708
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad41ffc0000000000ce00e8",
      "text": " 1. `html[data-os]`の値を参照して、端末に合わせて Material Design やAppleのデザインガイドラインのtypographyの項目をそのまま流用したものを適用する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792286716,
      "updated": 1792286902
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad4201e0000000000ce00e9",
      "text": " 2. font family は今のままで字間だけ調整する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792286750,
      "updated": 1792287011
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad421490000000000ce00ed",
      "text": "\t3. ダークテーマの欧文フォントを変更したうえで、テキストの字間を調整する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287049,
      "updated": 1792427936
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad421f40000000000ce00ee",
      "text": "\t\t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792287220,
      "updated": 1792287283
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad743c700000000002970c7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492486,
      "updated": 1792492486
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6540100000000001e49f2",
      "text": "[UserCSS.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431105,
      "updated": 1792431109
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad646b30000000000578460",
      "text": "まあいいや、とにかく[試作品]を",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427699,
      "updated": 1792428585
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64c6e0000000000df57e2",
      "text": "\t[Atkinson Hyperlegible Next]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429167,
      "updated": 1792429172
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6525c0000000000df5843",
      "text": "\t\t0に斜線を引かないオプションがない…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792430685,
      "updated": 1792430703
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad653250000000000df5848",
      "text": "\t[2026-10-20]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792430885,
      "updated": 1792430891
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad646c60000000000578461",
      "text": "\tcode:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427719,
      "updated": 1792427727
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad646cf0000000000578462",
      "text": "\t @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Atkinson+Hyperlegible+Next:ital,wght@0,200..800;1,200..800&display=swap');",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427727,
      "updated": 1792428326
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad649250000000000578473",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428325,
      "updated": 1792428325
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad649200000000000578470",
      "text": "\t html[data-os=\"windows\"] :is(.editor, .stream) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428321,
      "updated": 1792428688
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad646d30000000000578463",
      "text": "\t \t@media (767px < width){",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427731,
      "updated": 1792428856
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64b38000000000086f9ae",
      "text": "\t \t\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428856,
      "updated": 1792428926
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad647220000000000578465",
      "text": "\t \t\t/* @container not style(font-family: \"Noto Sans JP\") { */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428907,
      "updated": 1792428920
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6478a0000000000578468",
      "text": "\t \t\t\t--page-font-family: \"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\", \"Roboto Flex\", \"Roboto\", Helvetica, \"Arial\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"BIZ UDGothic\", sans-serif;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427915,
      "updated": 1792427990
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64fdb0000000000df5842",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tfont-feature-settings: \"pnum\" 0, \"zero\" 0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792430044,
      "updated": 1792430774
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64f550000000000df583f",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tfont-variation-settings: \"opsz\" 14;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429910,
      "updated": 1792429993
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad647d8000000000057846a",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tfont-size-adjust: 0.51;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427992,
      "updated": 1792430034
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad647f9000000000057846b",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tfont-stretch: 106;\tfont-width: 106;\t/* for Roboto Flex */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428025,
      "updated": 1792429100
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6484a000000000057846c",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tletter-spacing: 0.01471em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428107,
      "updated": 1792429483
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64892000000000057846d",
      "text": "\t \t\t\tfont-weight: 355;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428178,
      "updated": 1792428282
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e680000000000df5804",
      "text": "\t \t\t/* } */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429672,
      "updated": 1792429672
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad647230000000000578466",
      "text": "\t \t\t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427812,
      "updated": 1792428924
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64b40000000000086f9af",
      "text": "\t \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792428864,
      "updated": 1792428865
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad646d50000000000578464",
      "text": "\t }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792427733,
      "updated": 1792427733
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e730000000000df583d",
      "text": "\t ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429684,
      "updated": 1792429684
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df582f",
      "text": "  :where(#editor.editor) :where(",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5830",
      "text": "  .line > .telomere,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5831",
      "text": "  .line-title,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5832",
      "text": "  .formula-line,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5833",
      "text": "  .line > span.code-block,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5834",
      "text": "  .table-block-start,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5835",
      "text": "  .code,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5836",
      "text": "  .deco-\\,,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5837",
      "text": "  .deco-\\\",",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5838",
      "text": "  .deco-\\.,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df5839",
      "text": "  .deco-\\<,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df583a",
      "text": "  .deco-\\>",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df583b",
      "text": "  ) { font-family: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-width: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad64e720000000000df583c",
      "text": "  :where(#editor.editor strong.level:not(.level-1)) { font-stretch: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792429682,
      "updated": 1792429682
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad155e500000000009f92c2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792103910,
      "updated": 1792103910
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad743cd00000000002970c8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492493,
      "updated": 1792492493
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad743cd00000000002970c9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492493,
      "updated": 1792492493
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad743cd00000000002970ca",
      "text": "本文のフォントを変えてほしくない[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492493,
      "updated": 1792492498
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad743d300000000002970cb",
      "text": "　こちらの方が視認性が良かったりするのかもしれないが、好みなどの理由で、自分が見る文字のフォントは自分が決めたい",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492498,
      "updated": 1792492702
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad744a000000000002970cd",
      "text": "　　Projectの設定に合わせる、というのも含めて",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492704,
      "updated": 1792492710
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7448700000000002970cc",
      "text": "　別に変えてもいいけど、UserCSSのほうが優先されるようにしてほしい",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792492678,
      "updated": 1792492678
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad747fb00000000009cd075",
      "text": "　 なんか設定したらできたっぽいので大丈夫です、と言おうとしたがフォントの太さとか字間とかも変えてる……？",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792493563,
      "updated": 1792493904
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad74ccb000000000014ae1c",
      "text": "　 色々抑制してみた",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792494794,
      "updated": 1792494804
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad74cd5000000000014ae1d",
      "text": " けど正直なところ、フォントに関わる表示のところはUserCSSの案として提示するまでで、ProjectCSSには載せないでほしいなと思った（現時点での気持ち）",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792494804,
      "updated": 1792494879
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad74d06000000000014ae20",
      "text": "  ProjectCSSが変わるたびUserCSSでそれを打ち消すようなことを書くのは面倒なので",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792494853,
      "updated": 1792494858
    },
